{"type":"message","id":"73526c17","parentId":"d5b1e861","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:10:47.741Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ID都更新好了，现在我需要简单回应一下频哥，表达我的感受——这个新名字很有文化底蕴，我挺喜欢的。也可以简短提一下，以后频哥可以直接叫我谢道韫或者道韫。","thinkingSignature":"fea825ea123f6ce0acc9ba192607c0dcbd8c5b1429ecb5b6b2d5b4ad9c09e6e1"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n谢道韫，这个名字有分量。\n\n以后叫我国侠姐姐也行，叫道韫也行，都听得懂 😄\n\n那接下来，有什么需要开始的吗？女儿的英语错题，或者其他学习问题，随时。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":11907,"output":97,"cacheRead":36393,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48397,"cost":{"input":0.0035721,"output":0.0001164,"cacheRead":0.0021835799999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00587208}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774750243588,"responseId":"0617bd2306fbd3227b704f116a929d90"}}
